<button type=\"button\" class=\"min-h-[44px] rounded-lg border px-3 py-2 text-left text-xs font-semibold transition-all touch-manipulation border-border bg-card text-foreground hover:bg-secondary/40\" data-testid=\"opt-objetivo-Pérdida de Grasa / Recomposición\">Pérdida de Grasa / Recomposición</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"min-h-[44px] rounded-lg border px-3 py-2 text-left text-xs font-semibold transition-all touch-manipulation border-border bg-card text-foreground hover:bg-secondary/40\" data-testid=\"opt-objetivo-Fuerza Máxima &amp; Powerlifting\">Fuerza Máxima &amp; Powerlifting</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"min-h-[44px] rounded-lg border px-3 py-2 text-left text-xs font-semibold transition-all touch-manipulation border-border bg-card text-foreground hover:bg-secondary/40\" data-testid=\"opt-objetivo-Salud General &amp; Acondicionamiento\">Salud General &amp; Acondicionamiento</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"min-h-[44px] rounded-lg border px-3 py-2 text-left text-xs font-semibold transition-all touch-manipulation border-border bg-card text-foreground hover:bg-secondary/40\" data-testid=\"opt-objetivo-Rendimiento Deportivo\">Rendimiento Deportivo</button></div></div><div class=\"space-y-1.5\"><label for=\"cuestionario-experiencia\" class=\"text-xs font-bold text-foreground block\">2. ¿Qué nivel de experiencia previa tienes?</label><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-1.5 sm:grid-cols-3\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"min-h-[44px] rounded-lg border px-3 py-2 text-left text-xs font-semibold transition-all touch-manipulation border-border bg-card text-foreground hover:bg-secondary/40\" data-testid=\"opt-experiencia-Principiante (&lt; 1 año constante)\">Principiante (&lt; 1 año constante)</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"min-h-[44px] rounded-lg border px-3 py-2 text-left text-xs font-semibold transition-all touch-manipulation border-primary bg-primary/10 text-primary shadow-xs\" data-testid=\"opt-experiencia-Intermedio (1 a 3 años entrenando)\">Intermedio (1 a 3 años entrenando)</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"min-h-[44px] rounded-lg border px-3 py-2 text-left text-xs font-semibold transition-all touch-manipulation border-border bg-card text-foreground hover:bg-secondary/40\" data-testid=\"opt-experiencia-Avanzado (&gt; 3 años con sobrecarga)\">Avanzado (&gt; 3 años con sobrecarga)</button></div></div><div class=\"space-y-1.5\"><label class=\"text-xs font-bold text-foreground block\">3. ¿Cuántos días por semana puedes entrenar?</label><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"flex-1 min-h-[44px] rounded-lg border text-xs font-bold transition-all touch-manipulation border-border bg-card text-foreground hover:bg-secondary/40\" data-testid=\"opt-dias-2\">2 días</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"flex-1 min-h-[44px] rounded-lg border text-xs font-bold transition-all touch-manipulation border-border bg-card text-foreground hover:bg-secondary/40\" data-testid=\"opt-dias-3\">3 días</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"flex-1 min-h-[44px] rounded-lg border text-xs font-bold transition-all touch-manipulation border-primary bg-primary text-primary-foreground shadow-xs\" data-testid=\"opt-dias-4\">4 días</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"flex-1 min-h-[44px] rounded-lg border text-xs font-bold transition-all touch-manipulation border-border bg-card text-foreground hover:bg-secondary/40\" data-testid=\"opt-dias-5\">5 días</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"flex-1 min-h-[44px] rounded-lg border text-xs font-bold transition-all touch-manipulation border-border bg-card text-foreground hover:bg-secondary/40\" data-testid=\"opt-dias-6\">6 días</button></div></div><div class=\"space-y-1.5\"><label for=\"cuestionario-molestias\" class=\"text-xs font-bold text-foreground block\">4. ¿Tienes molestias o lesiones previas? (Opcional)</label><textarea id=\"cuestionario-molestias\" rows=\"2\" placeholder=\"Ej.: Dolor lumbar al hacer sentadillas pesadas, o molestia e